LangName: 1033 "Copyright Dale Thiessen 2015+AAogHAAA-Super Mario Maker" "" "Regular" "Super Mario Maker Extended" "" "Version 1.0" "" "FontStruct is a trademark of FontStruct.com" "https://fontstruct.com" "Dale Thiessen" "+IBwA-Super Mario Maker Extended+IB0A was built with FontStruct+AAoA-Designer description: <p>A recreation of the Super Mario Maker font. Now with lowercase characters and accents! UPDATES: Sep 13, 2015: I've also been made aware that the '7' has changed between the promotional material and the actual game. I've updated the actual '7' to reflect the in-game character as it is more legible. The '7' in the promotional art is now taking the place of the Dagger (+ICAA), because honestly, who uses that? In all seriousness, if anyone can suggest a better home for it, I'm all ears. Sep 17, 2015: Found a reference for the letter 'J' and updated accordingly. Nov 12, 2015: Several glyphs have been updated! Notable changes include the ugly old '*' being changed into a star, and the '+ICAA' being changed into a crown, as well as several minor tweaks here and there.</p>+AAogHAAA-Super Mario Maker" "https://fontstruct.com/fontstructions/show/1184080/super_mario_maker_extended" "https://fontstruct.com/fontstructors/show/239346/gnarizard" "Creative Commons Attribution Non-commercial Share Alike" "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/" "" "" "" "" "Five big quacking zephyrs jolt my wax bed"
